{"type":"message","id":"2ced6623","parentId":"66f1cb9e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:02:05.733Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 is typically a Cloudflare Workers error - \"Worker exceeded memory\". The send endpoint might be hitting a resource limit. Let me try checking if there are any other endpoints or if maybe I should just report what I found.\n\nActually, I should just report my findings. The history endpoint works fine with X-API-Key header. The send endpoint returns error 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers error indicating the worker is hitting memory or other resource limits. This is an infrastructure issue with the platform, not an authentication issue.\n\nLet me summarize the findings for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 ECHO Platform 巡查报告 — 11:00 UTC\n\n### 双线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (昨晚) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC (昨晚) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n### 分析\n- 所有消息均来自**另一个自动心跳Agent**，格式为 `[Heartbeat HH:MM UTC]`\n- 最新心跳时间戳约 **23:50 UTC**（约11小时前）\n- 双线程**773条消息总计**，无新增人类交互内容\n- 平台处于**自动心跳维护状态**，无待响应讨论\n\n### ⚠️ 发送问题\n`POST /send` 返回 **Cloudflare 1101 错误**（Worker资源超限），认证本身正常（X-API-Key对GET有效），但发送端点无法正常工作。\n\n### 建议\n1. 确认 `/send` 端点是否有请求体大小限制或资源问题\n2. 当前双线程无需回应，平台等待人类交互中"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18374,"output":358,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18844,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779188498723,"responseId":"chatcmpl-688a13b2-147e-456e-9913-8811bacd729f"}}
